0 A DSL point (x, y, z) in studs, studs, plates is the LDraw point (20y, -8z, -20x) in LDU.
0 Each origin is at minus the minimum corner of the part's rotated body box, which excludes studs.
0 Brick 2 x 4 at (0,0,0): body x -1..1, y -2..2, z -3..0, so the origin is (1,2,3).
